    {
      "GroupId": 10002030,
      "SelectionGroup": 0,
      "BGMId": 0,
      "Sound": "",
      "Transition": 0,
      "BGName": 0,
      "BGEffect": 0,
      "PopupFileName": "",
      "ScriptKr": "5;히후미 수영복ND;07;자아…… 모래성 만들기…… 다들 잘 하고 있으려나.\n#5;em;…",
      "TextJp": "すみません、お待たせしました。ちょっとお手洗いが遠くて……",
      "TextCn": "我看看……沙堡……堆得如何呢？",
      "TextTh": "เอ่อ... ก่อปราสาททราย... ทุกคนทำไปถึงไหนกันแล้วนะ",
      "TextTw": "我看看……沙堡……堆得如何呢？",
      "TextEn": "Right, back to sandcastles. I wonder how everything is going.",
      "VoiceJp": "https://r2.rikaaa0928.moe/ba-story-viewer/tts/event/10002030/lines/0003.mp3",
      "VoiceId": 0,
      "TeenMode": false,
      "TextJpVoice": "[apologetic]すみません、お待たせしました。[embarrassed]ちょっとお手洗いが遠くて……"
    },
    {
      "GroupId": 10002030,
      "SelectionGroup": 0,
      "BGMId": 0,
      "Sound": "",
      "Transition": 0,
      "BGName": 0,
      "BGEffect": 0,
      "PopupFileName": "",
      "ScriptKr": "5;히후미 수영복ND;02\n#5;em;[반응]\n#wait;1000",
      "TextJp": "",
      "TextCn": "",
      "TextTh": "",
      "TextTw": "",
      "TextEn": "",
      "VoiceJp": "",
      "VoiceId": 0,
      "TeenMode": false,
      "TextJpVoice": ""
    },
    {
      "GroupId": 10002030,
      "SelectionGroup": 0,
      "BGMId": 0,
      "Sound": "",
      "Transition": 0,
      "BGName": 0,
      "BGEffect": 0,
      "PopupFileName": "",
      "ScriptKr": "5;히후미 수영복ND;00;아, 선생님. 다들 잘 하고 있나요?\n#5;em;[반짝]\n#5;hophop\n#5;m3",
      "TextJp": "調子はいかがですか？",
      "TextCn": "啊，老师。\n情况还顺利吗？",
      "TextTh": "อ๊ะ คุณครู ทุกคนก่อปราสาททรายไปได้ด้วยดีไหมคะ?",
      "TextTw": "啊，老師。\n情況還順利嗎？",
      "TextEn": "Sensei! How are things holding up?",
      "VoiceJp": "https://r2.rikaaa0928.moe/ba-story-viewer/tts/event/10002030/lines/0005.mp3",
      "VoiceId": 0,
      "TeenMode": false,
      "TextJpVoice": "[delighted]調子はいかがですか？"
    },
    {
      "GroupId": 10002030,
      "SelectionGroup": 0,
      "BGMId": 0,
      "Sound": "",
      "Transition": 0,
      "BGName": 0,
      "BGEffect": 0,
      "PopupFileName": "",
      "ScriptKr": "5;히후미 수영복ND;03;잠깐 자리를 비우고 왔는데…….\n#5;em;[재잘]",
      "TextJp": "……先生？",
      "TextCn": "刚刚稍微离开了一下……",
      "TextTh": "ฉันหายไปแค่ครู่เดียว...",
      "TextTw": "剛剛稍微離開了一下……",
      "TextEn": "Sorry I had to step away.",
      "VoiceJp": "https://r2.rikaaa0928.moe/ba-story-viewer/tts/event/10002030/lines/0006.mp3",
      "VoiceId": 0,
      "TeenMode": false,
      "TextJpVoice": "[curious]……先生？"
    },
    {
      "GroupId": 10002030,
      "SelectionGroup": 0,
      "BGMId": 0,
      "Sound": "",
      "Transition": 0,
      "BGName": 0,
      "BGEffect": 0,
      "PopupFileName": "",
      "ScriptKr": "[s1] 말없이 해변 반대편을 응시한다.\n[s2] \"저쪽에……\"",
      "TextJp": "[s1] 無言で向こうの方を見つめる。\n[s2] \"えっと、あんな感じに……。\"",
      "TextCn": "[s1]无言地望着海边的另一头\n[s2]「呃，就在那边……」",
      "TextTh": "[s1] จ้องไปที่ชายหาดอีกด้านหนึ่งโดยไม่พูดอะไร\n[s2] \"คือด้านโน้น...\"",
      "TextTw": "[s1] 無言地望著海邊的另一頭\n[s2]「呃，就在那邊……」",
      "TextEn": "[s1] Look over at the other side of the beach.\n[s2] \"Well...\"",
      "VoiceJp": "",
      "VoiceId": 0,
      "TeenMode": false,
      "TextJpVoice": ""
    },
